# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# AppVelocity — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# Never commit .env to version control.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Figma (required for DesignToCodeAgent) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Generate at: https://www.figma.com/settings → Personal Access Tokens
FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=figd_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── LLM (at least one required) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Which provider to use: openai | anthropic
LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic

# Anthropic — https://console.anthropic.com/
# Used by PlannerAgent, CriticAgent, and GeneratorAgent nodes
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6

# OpenAI (optional fallback) — https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# Strong model for Planner & Critic agents
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o
# Fast model for simpler tasks
OPENAI_FAST_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ── Web App ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Caching — Redis (optional, falls back to in-memory) ──────────────────────
REDIS_ENABLED=false
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# ── Rate Limiting ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
FIGMA_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=60
LLM_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=50
PARALLEL_REQUESTS=5

# ── Logging ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LOG_LEVEL=info
# Verbose debug output (use appvelocity:* for everything)
DEBUG=

# ── Development ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development

# ── Agent Settings ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Max LangGraph reflection iterations before giving up
MAX_ITERATIONS=3
# Cache Figma API responses to disk (speeds up re-runs on same file)
IR_CACHE_ENABLED=true

# ── Telemetry (opt-in, default off) ──────────────────────────────────────────
TELEMETRY_ENABLED=false
SENTRY_DSN=
